    {
      "name": "dsh-archive-rsi",
      "title": {
        "en": "Session archive + PDCA alchemy",
        "zh": "归档会话与 PDCA 炼金"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "CRUD over the Harness session archive plus a PDCA loop that mines historical sessions into measurable findings and adoptable context patches: tool-error rate, correction rate, verification gaps, context pressure and tool-catalog cost, each with session-level evidence, then re-measured after adoption. Tool-layer recursive self-improvement with a sidebar panel.",
        "zh": "会话归档 CRUD + PDCA 数据炼金：从历史会话里算出工具错误率、纠正率、编辑后未验证缺口、上下文压力与工具目录成本，给出带会话级证据的 finding 与可采纳的上下文补丁，采纳后再用后续会话重估。带侧边栏面板的工具层递归自我改进。"
      },
